{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43155","headline":"吴江别王长史 · 张怀","name":"吴江别王长史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多年襆被玉山岑，鬓雪欺人忽满簪。\n驽马虽然贪短豆，野麋终是忆长林。\n鲈鱼未得乘归兴，鸥鸟惟应信此心。\n见说新桥好风景，会须乘月濯烦襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张怀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}